---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Marine Cargo Insurance in Cambodia | AG Cambodia"
  description="Marine insurance covers the loss or damage of ships, cargo, terminals, and any transport by which property is transferred between origin and final destination."
  quoteHref="#form"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-grid">
        <div class="page-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/general-insurance-in-cambodia/">General Insurance</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Marine Cargo</span>
          </nav>
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">General Insurance</p>
          <h1>Marine Cargo Insurance in Cambodia</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">Marine insurance covers the loss or damage of ships, cargo, terminals, and any transport by which property is transferred, acquired, or held between the points of origin and final destination.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
            <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">Call us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero-visual">
          <img src="/assets/cargo-marine-insurance.webp" alt="Ship captain overlooking a container port" width="600" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article-grid">
        <div class="article-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Marine Cargo Insurance</p>
          <h2>Protection from origin to destination</h2>
          <p>Marine insurance covers the loss or damage of ships, cargo, terminals, and any transport or cargo by which property is transferred, acquired, or held between the points of origin and final destination.</p>
          <p>Cargo insurance is a sub-branch of marine insurance, though Marine also includes onshore and offshore exposed property (container terminals, ports, oil platforms, pipelines), Hull, Marine Casualty, and Marine Liability.</p>
          <p>As your broker, we look at what you ship, how often, on which routes and under which Incoterms. We then compare cargo cover from several insurers, for a single shipment or an annual open policy, and present you the most suitable options to choose from.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>

        <aside class="peril-card">
          <h3>What marine insurance includes</h3>
          <ul class="peril-list">
            <li>Cargo Insurance</li>
            <li>Hull Insurance</li>
            <li>Marine Casualty</li>
            <li>Marine Liability</li>
            <li>Onshore &amp; Offshore Property</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="notice-box">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></circle><path d="M12 8v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="12" cy="16" r="0.9" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg>
        <p><strong>Sending by mail or courier?</strong> When goods are transported by mail or courier, shipping insurance is used instead of marine cargo insurance.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who needs it -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who needs it</p>
      <h2>Protection for every link in the chain</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">From the port to the warehouse, marine cargo insurance protects the value of goods in transit.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 17c2 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0 1.8 1.4 4.2 1.4 6 0M5 17V9l4-3h4l4 3v2M9 6v3M15 6v3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Trade</span>
          <h3>Importers &amp; Exporters</h3>
          <p>Protect goods in transit between origin and destination, by sea, air, or land.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V10l4-2v13M13 21V6l4-2v17M9 13h0M9 17h0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Logistics</span>
          <h3>Freight &amp; Logistics</h3>
          <p>Cover for cargo moving through your supply chain, from warehouse to final delivery.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13M9 21v-6h6v6M4 21h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Marine</span>
          <h3>Vessel &amp; Terminal Operators</h3>
          <p>Hull, casualty, and liability cover for ships, container terminals, and port infrastructure.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free Marine Cargo quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your shipment or fleet. Compare offers from multiple insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential: your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your shipment and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
